02:07:49.010 --> 02:07:49.848
&gt;&gt; The Ernest C.

02:07:49.848 --> 02:07:54.205
Arbuckle Award is presented to a second
year MBA student who is nominated and

02:07:54.205 --> 02:07:56.430
chosen by his or her peers.

02:07:56.430 --> 02:07:57.720
The recipient, by his or

02:07:57.720 --> 02:08:03.310
her active participation, initiative,
leadership and personal integrity.

02:08:03.310 --> 02:08:06.360
As seen as having contributed most to the
fulfillment of the goals of

02:08:06.360 --> 02:08:11.560
the Graduate School of Business, both
within school and society at large.

02:08:11.560 --> 02:08:15.050
Classmates described this year's award
recipient as someone who went above and

02:08:15.050 --> 02:08:19.020
beyond to ensure the GSB experience, in
both the academic and

02:08:19.020 --> 02:08:23.440
extracurric, curricular realms, was
positive for everyone.

02:08:23.440 --> 02:08:26.310
One of you wrote, this person, has, time
and

02:08:26.310 --> 02:08:30.460
again, demonstrated a commitment to the
values and goals of the GSB.

02:08:30.460 --> 02:08:33.820
In the classroom, this person is an active
participant.

02:08:33.820 --> 02:08:39.160
Always prepared, and never hesitant to
chime in with a smart question or comment.

02:08:39.160 --> 02:08:42.510
Some of you mentioned that this person has
helped you understand concepts, and

02:08:42.510 --> 02:08:43.629
prepare for exams.

02:08:44.850 --> 02:08:47.230
Outside of the classroom, this person has
shined, and

02:08:47.230 --> 02:08:51.830
has probably coordinated more events than
anyone else in our class.

02:08:51.830 --> 02:08:54.620
A number of classmates describe this
person as a kind and

02:08:54.620 --> 02:08:59.250
committed friend, with a caring heart and
tremendous integrity.

02:08:59.250 --> 02:09:03.540
One of you wrote, Hishi will always stop
to say hi.

02:09:03.540 --> 02:09:07.710
Seems to have a nickname for everyone, and
doesn't go out of his or

02:09:07.710 --> 02:09:11.660
her way to help a friend, classmate, staff
member,

02:09:11.660 --> 02:09:16.310
faculty or anyone who happens to be
walking around campus.

02:09:16.310 --> 02:09:20.170
You wrote that this person exemplifies the
GSB spirit by being one of

02:09:20.170 --> 02:09:23.980
the most engaged and hardest working
members of your class.

02:09:23.980 --> 02:09:28.840
This person served as an Arbuckle fellow,
leadership fellow, on the c for

02:09:28.840 --> 02:09:35.250
c committee, and is co-president of GSB
gives back,

02:09:35.250 --> 02:09:38.110
and co-chair of the charity auction and
white party.

02:09:39.170 --> 02:09:43.440
In addition, hosted many informal social
gatherings for

02:09:43.440 --> 02:09:45.212
the entire body, the student body.

02:09:45.212 --> 02:09:46.326
&gt;&gt; [NOISE] [APPLAUSE].

02:09:46.326 --> 02:09:51.424
&gt;&gt; I am delighted to present this year's
Arbuckle award to Peter Varellas.

02:09:51.424 --> 02:09:52.643
Congratulations Peter.

02:09:52.643 --> 02:09:53.502
&gt;&gt; [NOISE].

02:09:53.502 --> 02:10:10.270
[APPLAUSE].

02:10:31.280 --> 02:10:34.450
&gt;&gt; The Alexander Robichek Student
Achievement Award in Finance was

02:10:34.450 --> 02:10:38.750
established to honor Professor Robichek's
outstanding contribution to the teaching

02:10:38.750 --> 02:10:43.520
of finance at the Stanford School of
Business from 1960 till his death in 1978.

02:10:43.520 --> 02:10:48.870
The award is given to an MBA student
selected by the finance faculty.

02:10:48.870 --> 02:10:51.870
For outstanding achievement in finance
courses.

02:10:51.870 --> 02:10:54.090
The recipient gets the award and also has
his or

02:10:54.090 --> 02:10:56.130
her name engraved on the plaque at the
GSB.

02:10:56.130 --> 02:11:00.960
I am delighted that this year's recipient
who has not only excelled in the study of

02:11:00.960 --> 02:11:06.120
finance, but have also contributed to the
broader academic environment at the GSB.

02:11:06.120 --> 02:11:09.140
By serving as a member of the academic
committee.

02:11:09.140 --> 02:11:11.605
The 2014 Robocheck award winner is Dave
Shaw.

02:11:11.605 --> 02:11:12.865
[NOISE].

02:11:12.865 --> 02:11:27.430
